.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-opentofu-state-delete \- Delete a state or a specific version of a state.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab opentofu state delete  [] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Prompts for confirmation before deletion. Use \fB--force\fR to skip
the confirmation prompt.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-f\fP, \fB--force\fP[=false]
	Force delete the state without prompting.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Delete a state and all its versions
glab opentofu state delete production

# Delete only a specific version of a state, by serial
glab opentofu state delete production 42

# Delete without the confirmation prompt
glab opentofu state delete production --force
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-opentofu-state(1)\fP
